  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 10.1\tThe side extension would not appear secondary to the house and due to the chamfered design of the extension which follows the boundary line in an highly prominent location it is considered that the proposed side extension would detract from the appearance of the house and street scene and would be inconsistent with the UDP policies ENV-B.1.1, H.6.4 and the Residential Extension Guidelines.",
    "Condition : 2 - 10.2\tThe side extension would be harmful to neighbours' living conditions as it would block daylight and sunlight to the ground floor windows at 4 George Street during a significant proportion of the day due to the southern aspect of the windows contrary to adopted UDP policy ENV-B.1.1."
